---
layout: layouts/base.njk
pagination:
  data: visaComparisons
  size: 1
  alias: comp
permalink: "/compare/visa-roi/{{ comp.slug }}/"
eleventyComputed:
  pageTitle: "{{ comp.destination.name }} {{ comp.destination.visaName }} vs. {{ comp.home.name }} Tax ROI Calculator (2026)"
  pageDescription: "Stop overpaying in {{ comp.home.name }}. Calculate your tax savings with the {{ comp.destination.name }} {{ comp.destination.visaName }}. Potential savings: ${{ comp.savings100k | localeString }} per $100k earned."
---

{% include "partials/breadcrumbs.njk" %}

<div class="section-container mt-16 pb-24">
    {# Hero Section #}
    <div class="text-center mb-16 reveal">
        <div class="badge-2026 mb-6" style="background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.1); color: #10b981; border-color: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.2);">
            <span class="pulse-dot"></span>
            2026 Tax ROI Analysis
        </div>
        <h1 class="aura-title mb-6">
            {{ comp.destination.name }} <span class="text-dim" style="font-weight:300;">vs.</span> {{ comp.home.name }}
        </h1>
        <p class="text-dim mx-auto" style="max-width: 800px; font-size: 1.25rem;">
            Stop losing <strong>{{ comp.home.taxRate | percentInt }}</strong> of your income. Moving to {{ comp.destination.name }} under the <strong>{{ comp.destination.visaName }}</strong> could be your biggest financial move of 2026.
        </p>
    </div>

    {# ROI Dashboard #}
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8 mb-16 reveal">
        {# Left: Home Tax #}
        <div class="glass-panel p-8 text-center" style="border-top: 4px solid #ef4444;">
            <span class="text-dim small block mb-4 uppercase font-bold tracking-widest">Current Situation ({{ comp.home.name }})</span>
            <div class="h2 mb-2" style="color: #ef4444;">{{ comp.home.taxRate | percentInt }}</div>
            <p class="text-dim mb-0">{{ comp.home.type }}</p>
            <div class="mt-6 pt-6 border-t border-white-5">
                <span class="text-dim small block mb-1">Tax on $100,000</span>
                <div class="h4 mb-0">${{ (100000 * comp.home.taxRate) | localeString }}</div>
            </div>
        </div>

        {# Middle: The Alpha #}
        <div class="glass-panel p-8 text-center" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.1), rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.5)); border: 1px solid #10b981;">
            <div class="h1 mb-4" style="color: #10b981; font-size: 4rem;">{{ comp.roiMultiple }}x</div>
            <h3 class="mb-2">Tax Efficiency</h3>
            <p class="text-dim">You keep {{ comp.roiMultiple }}x more of your gross income compared to staying in {{ comp.home.name }}.</p>
            <div class="mt-8 p-4 rounded-xl bg-white-5 border border-white-10">
                <span class="text-dim small block mb-1">Annual Tax Savings</span>
                <div class="h2 mb-0" style="color: #10b981;">+${{ comp.savings100k | localeString }}</div>
                <p class="small text-dim mb-0">per $100k gross revenue</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        {# Right: Destination Tax #}
        <div class="glass-panel p-8 text-center" style="border-top: 4px solid var(--aura-primary);">
            <span class="text-dim small block mb-4 uppercase font-bold tracking-widest">The Move ({{ comp.destination.name }})</span>
            <div class="h2 mb-2" style="color: var(--aura-primary);">{{ comp.destination.tax | percentInt }}</div>
            <p class="text-dim mb-0">{{ comp.destination.visaName }}</p>
            <div class="mt-6 pt-6 border-t border-white-5">
                <span class="text-dim small block mb-1">Tax on $100,000</span>
                <div class="h4 mb-0">${{ (100000 * comp.destination.tax) | localeString }}</div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    {# Deep Dive Content #}
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 mb-24 reveal">
        <div>
            <h2 class="mb-6">The Financial Logic</h2>
            <p class="text-dim mb-6" style="font-size: 1.1rem; line-height: 1.7;">
                Most remote professionals in the {{ comp.home.name }} are taxed as resident employees or sole traders, facing effective rates as high as <strong>{{ comp.home.taxRate | percentInt }}</strong> when including social contributions. 
            </p>
            <p class="text-dim mb-8" style="font-size: 1.1rem; line-height: 1.7;">
                By securing the <strong>{{ comp.destination.name }} {{ comp.destination.visaName }}</strong>, you transition to a strategic tax regime designed to attract high-value talent. In {{ site.year }}, this isn't just a lifestyle choice—it's a capital preservation strategy.
            </p>

            <div class="glass-panel p-6">
                <h3 class="h4 mb-4">Monthly Wealth Compounding</h3>
                <div class="flex items-center gap-6">
                    <div class="flex-center w-16 h-16 rounded-full bg-primary-10 border border-primary text-2xl">📈</div>
                    <div>
                        <div class="h3 mb-1">+${{ comp.monthlySavings | localeString }}/mo</div>
                        <p class="text-dim mb-0">Extra capital to reinvest, save, or spend every single month.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div>
            <h2 class="mb-6">Relocation Requirements</h2>
            <div class="glass-panel p-8">
                <div class="flex-between mb-4 border-b border-white-5 pb-4">
                    <span class="text-dim">Min. Income Monthly:</span>
                    <strong class="text-white">${{ comp.destination.minIncomeMonthly | localeString }}</strong>
                </div>
                <div class="flex-between mb-4 border-b border-white-5 pb-4">
                    <span class="text-dim">Tax Duration:</span>
                    <strong class="text-white">{{ comp.destination.taxDuration }}</strong>
                </div>
                <div class="flex-between mb-4 border-b border-white-5 pb-4">
                    <span class="text-dim">Visa Duration:</span>
                    <strong class="text-white">{{ comp.destination.visaDuration }}</strong>
                </div>
                <div class="flex-between mb-6">
                    <span class="text-dim">Processing Time:</span>
                    <strong class="text-white">{{ comp.destination.processingTime }}</strong>
                </div>

                <h4 class="mb-4">Key Conditions:</h4>
                <ul class="clean-list">
                    {% for req in comp.destination.requirements | slice(0, 3) %}
                    <li class="flex items-start gap-3 mb-3 text-dim small">
                        <span class="text-primary">✓</span> {{ req }}
                    </li>
                    {% endfor %}
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    {# Success Stack / Toolkit #}
    <div class="mb-24 reveal">
        <h2 class="text-center mb-12">The {{ comp.destination.name }} Relocation Toolkit</h2>
        {% set country_data = { name: comp.destination.name, slug: comp.destination.slug, country: comp.destination.name, continent: comp.destination.continent, visa: comp.destination.visaName, currency: comp.destination.currency, isEurope: (comp.destination.continent == "Europe") } %}
        {% set country = country_data %}
        {% include "partials/relocation-toolkit.njk" %}
    </div>

    {# Pro Upsell #}
    <div id="pro-upsell" class="glass-panel reveal text-center p-12 border-accent" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.05), rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.8));">
        <div class="badge-2026 mb-6" style="background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.1); color: #f59e0b; border-color: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.2);">Limited Pro Report</div>
        <h2 class="aura-title mb-6" style="font-size: 2.5rem;">Download the Full {{ comp.destination.name }} Tax Strategy</h2>
        <p class="text-dim mx-auto mb-10" style="max-width: 700px; font-size: 1.15rem;">
            Go beyond the numbers. Our Pro Report includes lawyer contacts, local bank setup guides, and the exact paperwork checklist used by 500+ successful applicants.
        </p>
        <div class="flex justify-center gap-6 flex-wrap">
            <button id="unlock-pro-btn" class="aura-button" style="background: #f59e0b; color: #000; font-weight: 800;">Get Pro Report for $19 →</button>
            <a href="/visas/{{ comp.destination.slug }}/" class="aura-button-secondary">Read Full Visa Guide</a>
        </div>
    </div>

    {# Related ROI Comparisons #}
    <div class="pt-24 border-t border-white-5 reveal">
        <h2 class="text-center mb-12">Compare {{ comp.destination.name }} vs. Other Home Countries</h2>
        <div class="partner-grid">
            {% for related in visaComparisons %}
                {% if related.destination.slug == comp.destination.slug and related.slug != comp.slug %}
                <a href="/compare/visa-roi/{{ related.slug }}/" class="partner-card">
                    <div class="flex-between mb-4">
                        <span class="text-dim small font-bold">{{ related.destination.name }}</span>
                        <span class="text-dim small font-bold">VS</span>
                        <span class="text-dim small font-bold">{{ related.home.name }}</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="small text-dim mb-0">View ROI Analysis →</p>
                </a>
                {% endif %}
            {% endfor %}
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
